    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Property (Nick)</strong></p><p>When you make the extra attack of the Light property, you can make it as part of the Attack action instead of taking a Bonus Action. This is essential to keep your Bonus Action free for your class features and weapon abilities.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Demon Mode</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you envelop yourself in an aura of boundless stamina for 1 minute (or until you are Incapacitated). You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, regaining all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. While active, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Your walking speed increases by 10 feet.</li><li>The extra attack you make using the weapon's Light property deals an additional [[/r 1d4]] slashing damage on a hit.</li></ul></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Demon Dodge</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p><p>While Demon Mode is active, if you are hit by a melee attack from a creature you can see, you can use your Reaction to add your Proficiency Bonus to your AC against that attack, potentially causing it to miss. If the attack misses, you can immediately move 5 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Property (Nick)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Demon Mode</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Demon Dodge</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p></div>"
    },
